== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added 20 missing Afterbirth items and 11 missing trinkets.

=== Changes ===
* Increased {{i|Box of Friends}} charge 2 → 4.
* Increased {{i|D7}} charge 1 → 3.
* {{i|Glass Cannon}} now affects [[soul heart]]s.
* Decreased [[Azazel]]'s damage and charge rate.
* [[Restock Machine]]s now blow up if bombed repeatedly.
* Removed [[blood donation machine]]s from [[Greed mode]].
* Using {{p|XIV - Temperance}} in Greed mode now always spawn a [[Devil Beggar]].

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed the {{a|Blue Womb}} [[achievement]] not unlocking.
* Defeating [[Hush]] now correctly plays [[ending 17]].

